 \u00e1rboles, Trocha Shihuahuaco, escalada en Clibing a una plataforma lupuna, y en la misma Hacienda Herrera.\nAdem\u00e1s 4 videos con contenido exclusivo de c\u00e1maras trampa en la selva de madre de Dios.", "short_description": "Primer aplicativo con recorridos 360\u00b0 de la selva en Puerto Maldonado"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logo-512.png", "id": "2055343438150768", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572927_2055343441484101_8652722561279519607_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kL8zVxWvWG0Q7kNvwFrh5iX&_nc_oc=AdqsH-Bf5jhiapd8L__4VPkDZtI38KXWmSH9kStg511hV8C0gwyBEEMbHpOlIStM8Bc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRd-gtkZGHRXYnNi1gZS09qI19LU7iZCbYOpd8UDx9umw&oe=6B01D354"}, {"file_name": "1440 HH.png", "id": "1725009814685831", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57570294_1725009818019164_2794798217413603034_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0anVIUCahQUQ7kNvwF2-5MY&_nc_oc=AdpLk9pHV65wItjbXfCiBxpYZDNd6yPYBkW81tBgsHT96Md50W177tPJfGvVMR1R7J4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTvKq-XEZAuHo-46oUu2NcaDP61mugW8tTfZ4TpuexHug&oe=6B01C99D"}, {"file_name": "7x10HH.png", "id": "1264346464967416", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031597_1264346468300749_4624995628890807215_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XSthROlCC9YQ7kNvwHF7_hM&_nc_oc=AdoQIPN7sbs4WCLO7pUX4WuIen5wYnBNLQB66QFZghQ1pkQlabjUotb--OOXkjN1_58&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQStOsPDODbAVlgncPa5Jxl_laPtKFFrXdofCG3fQo7wXg&oe=6B01BDB4"}, {"file_name": "Mesa de trabajo 3hherrera.png", "id": "705420821469944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-2